62e1cf9b-2004-4e61-b74a-c6974024c353	534c4b25-c5a4-4cec-9e2c-f9423b4e711f	11b4ec10-0d65-41a1-8042-dad9046af4a2	14	assistant	agent	conversor	\N	**Question: What is FastAPI?**\n\n**Suggested answer:**\n\nFastAPI is a modern Python web framework built for building APIs quickly and with high performance. It's built on top of Starlette for the web parts and Pydantic for data validation, and it's designed for asynchronous programming from the ground up—so it handles concurrent requests very efficiently.\n\nWhat makes FastAPI stand out is that it automatically generates interactive API documentation for you, validates request and response data automatically, and has a much simpler syntax than Flask or Django for building APIs. If you're building REST APIs or microservices and want something lightweight but powerful, FastAPI is an excellent choice. It's become really popular in recent years because it combines ease of use with excellent performance.	claude-haiku-4-5-20251001	1215	178	2273	{"roles": {"interviewee": "mic", "interviewer": "unknown"}}	2026-09-30 05:44:12.925606+00	2026-09-30 05:44:13.12891+00
