973053c8-8005-4770-82cf-a9c4dfb6a5b7	0adb9676-1aa8-4d56-a6d2-b893cccdebf1	d4f925c8-f7c8-4d5c-82fb-b1d8c002e5b8	2	assistant	agent	conversor	\N	**Question: What is Django?**\n\nDjango is a high-level Python web framework that makes it easy to build web applications quickly. It follows the Model-View-Template architecture and handles a lot of the heavy lifting for you—things like database management, user authentication, and URL routing—so you can focus on writing your application logic. It's particularly good for building scalable, secure applications with built-in features like an admin panel and ORM for database queries. I've used it on [*mention a specific project if you have one*] where it really helped us get a prototype working fast while maintaining clean, maintainable code.	claude-haiku-4-5-20251001	662	150	2824	{"roles": {"interviewee": "mic", "interviewer": "unknown"}}	2026-09-30 05:52:04.546774+00	2026-09-30 05:52:04.763331+00
