86b10280-1573-4b2e-8181-a15dfc561bee	02df8b6e-6dee-4f4e-90fd-12cd3c469fab	9dc5ca8c-1360-4565-85b1-3cbd48ab0531	60	assistant	agent	conversor	\N	Q: Liveness vs readiness, extra detail (no new question heard)\n**Keep liveness cheap and self-contained; put dependency checks in readiness only.**\n- A liveness probe that checks DB/Redis causes cascading restarts during a dependency outage.\n- Readiness failure only drops the pod from Service endpoints; the pod is not restarted.\n- Startup probe holds liveness and readiness off until the app finishes booting (e.g. model loading).\n- Rolling updates wait on readiness, so a bad release never receives traffic.\n- Tune `failureThreshold` × `periodSeconds` so a brief GC pause or slow response doesn't trigger a restart.	claude-sonnet-5-5	9068	521	5085	{"roles": {"interviewee": "mic", "interviewer": "loopback"}}	2026-10-21 07:03:51.977551+00	2026-10-21 07:03:52.17359+00
