9c9bca34-7729-4264-8ea8-1c976473a1fa	dd95af7c-f247-464d-9525-e7586117b032	708e11ae-d07d-46f3-8c8e-d5f3fb16a23d	161	assistant	agent	chat	\N	**Draw this in Paint (boxes and arrows):**\n\n```\n        ┌──────────────┐\n        │     USER     │◄──────────────────────────┐\n        │ writes essay │                           │\n        └──────┬───────┘                           │\n               │ submit                            │ rewrite + resubmit\n               ▼                                   │ (attempt += 1)\n      ┌─────────────────┐                          │\n      │  Intake / State │  (essay, attempt, scores)│\n      └────────┬────────┘                          │\n               │ fan-out (parallel)                │\n     ┌─────────┼──────────┬───────────┐            │\n     ▼         ▼          ▼           ▼            │\n┌─────────┐┌─────────┐┌─────────┐┌─────────┐       │\n│ Domain  ││ Grammar ││ Context/││ (more   │       │\n│knowledge││ & Punct.││Structure││ criteria│       │\n│ agent   ││ agent   ││ agent   ││ if any) │       │\n│ 0–10    ││ 0–10    ││ 0–10    ││ 0–10    │       │\n└────┬────┘└────┬────┘└────┬────┘└────┬────┘       │\n     └──────────┴────┬─────┴──────────┘            │\n                     │ fan-in (reducer merges scores)\n                     ▼                             │\n            ┌─────────────────┐                    │\n            │   Aggregator    │                    │\n            │ avg = mean(scores)                   │\n            └────────┬────────┘                    │\n                     ▼                             │\n              ◇ avg ≥ 7 ? ◇                        │\n             /              \\                      │\n        YES /                \\ NO                  │\n           ▼                  ▼                    │\n   ┌──────────────┐   ┌────────────────────┐       │\n   │ Final result │   │ Feedback generator │       │\n   │ score + notes│   │ (what to fix)      │       │\n   └──────┬───────┘   └─────────┬──────────┘       │\n          │                     ▼                  │\n          ▼              ┌─────────────┐           │\n        USER             │ Human-in-   │───────────┘\n                         │ the-loop    │\n                         │ interrupt() │\n                         └─────────────┘\n              (attempt > max → escalate / stop)\n```\n\n**Say while drawing:**\n- **Parallel evaluators:** each one is independent, so they run concurrently. Each returns structured JSON (`score`, `reasons`).\n- **Reducer:** `scores: Annotated[list, operator.add]` safely merges the parallel writes into one state key.\n- **Conditional edge:** the router checks `avg ≥ 7`. If it passes, the graph ends. If not, it goes to the feedback node.\n- **Loop-back:** `interrupt()` pauses the graph and waits for the user. On resubmit it resumes from a checkpointer using the same `thread_id`, with an attempt counter.\n- **Guardrail:** a max-attempts cap prevents an infinite loop.\n- **Extensibility:** adding a new criterion just means adding another evaluator node in the fan-out.\n\nDraw the rectangles, the diamond, and the arrows from the diagram in that order. The two things to emphasize are the parallel fan-out/fan-in and the feedback loop.	claude-sonnet-5-5	8916	1182	9466	{}	2026-10-21 11:13:16.470328+00	2026-10-21 11:34:13.668772+00
