ered customer and staff clients on a shared claims contract, with per-service data ownership.\n\nYour documents contain no production metrics. If the interviewer asks for numbers, quote your own measured results rather than anything I'd supply.	claude-sonnet-5-5	16324	1245	9290	{}	2026-10-25 05:04:26.069232+00	2026-10-25 05:04:26.6969+00
