ecdca8ac-f745-48c0-a76f-3e403eb7fbe2	37ed911e-34d2-48c8-94d2-9ddced0e1e94	5a0c3f16-ef2c-400f-9a78-7f80d16624e2	253	assistant	agent	conversor	\N	Q: Write the decorator that changes add to subtract\n**Wrap `add` in a decorator whose `wrapper` returns a different operation.**\n```python\ndef change_op(op):\n    def deco(func):\n        def wrapper(a, b):\n            return op(a, b)\n        return wrapper\n    return deco\n\n@change_op(lambda a, b: a - b)\ndef add(a, b):\n    return a + b\n\nprint(add(5, 3))  # 2\n```\n- Original three lines of `add` stay untouched\n- Pass `lambda a, b: a * b` for multiplication\n- Without `@`: `sub = change_op(lambda a, b: a - b)(add)` keeps `add` intact\n- Add `@functools.wraps(func)` on `wrapper` to keep `add`'s name and docstring	claude-opus-5-5	7840	543	2686	{"roles": {"interviewee": "mic", "interviewer": "loopback"}}	2026-10-27 09:49:35.721682+00	2026-10-27 09:49:35.842834+00
