acd4a09d-eae3-424f-b491-c3b386d5e873	c430e60a-14cf-40ea-bb6b-134af682ebbb	ae20be1e-5510-47a9-864b-76cbdc572ad0	214	assistant	agent	conversor	\N	Q: Concrete EKS scaling/reliability issue in production; how diagnosed?\n\n**Audit-season spike: pods scaled, but [Bedrock throttling / DB connection exhaustion] caused timeouts.**\n- Symptom: p99 latency and 5xx jumped in Grafana during [filing peak].\n- Diagnosis: Tempo traces showed time stuck in [Bedrock call / DB pool].\n- Confirmed via CloudWatch [ThrottlingException / connection count] metrics.\n- Fix: moved agent calls behind SQS, so API returns job ID and polls status.\n- Circuit breaker plus backoff; capped concurrency per tenant; resume from checkpoint.	claude-opus-5-5	8837	746	3462	{"roles": {"interviewee": "mic", "interviewer": "loopback"}}	2026-10-27 16:18:43.290054+00	2026-10-27 16:18:42.748401+00
