86bf41bb-72af-463f-8049-6080f47e2362	f022a035-22db-48ae-8763-f72c4f0a9129	9726290b-a764-4c7b-afd0-a9861b72885c	105	assistant	agent	screen_analyzer	\N	**Problem:** Same screen as before (3/10 passing). `get_total_minutes` must skip skipped sessions. `get_longest_daily_streak_by_user()` returns `{user_id: longest run of consecutive days}`, with all-skipped users at 0.\n\n**Pseudocode:**\n```\n1. Minutes: sum minutes_listened for this user where not skipped\n2. For each session, create days[user] = set() if missing\n3. If not skipped, add the day to that user's set\n4. For each user, best = 0\n5. For each day d with d-1 not in the set (a run start), count forward while d+n is in the set\n6. best = max(best, n); store best\n```\n\n**Code:**\n```python\ndef get_total_minutes(self, user_id: str) -> int:\n    total = 0\n    for s in self.sessions:\n        if s.user_id == user_id and not s.skipped:\n            total += s.minutes_listened\n    return total\n\ndef get_longest_daily_streak_by_user(self):\n    days = {}\n    for s in self.sessions:\n        if s.user_id not in days:\n            days[s.user_id] = set()  # all-skipped users still appear\n        if not s.skipped:\n            days[s.user_id].add(s.day)  # set dedups same-day sessions\n    result = {}\n    for uid, ds in days.items():\n        best = 0\n        for d in ds:\n            if d - 1 not in ds:  # only start at a run's first day\n                n = 1\n                while d + n in ds:\n                    n += 1\n                best = max(best, n)\n        result[uid] = best\n    return result\n```\n\n**Explanation:**\n- Idea: Count runs only from their first day, using a set for O(1) lookups.\n- Why correct: Each run is counted once, from its start, and extended to its end.\n- Edge cases: empty sessions, all-skipped user (0), same-day duplicates, gaps, unsorted days, all handled.\n- Complexity: O(n) time and space; sorting each user's days costs O(n log n).\n\n**Alternate method:** Sort each user's unique days and scan, resetting the count on a gap. O(n log n) time, simpler but slower.	claude-sonnet-5-5	5272	964	9499	{}	2026-10-28 08:00:32.034301+00	2026-10-28 08:00:31.538016+00
