ow-level security,\nSQS, Redis, OpenTelemetry/Langfuse. Name anything else generically.\n```\n\nThe tool restriction in that prompt keeps the design to tools you can defend in the interview.\n\n**Tips**\n- The scenario text I can see is cut off. Paste the rest into OpenCode, or point it at the file that contains it, so it doesn't guess at the requirements.\n- If `opencode.json` sets a model or provider, check that it works before you start.\n- Dismiss the Pylance popup with "No" or "Never".	claude-sonnet-5-5	3696	1249	10523	{}	2026-10-28 13:00:55.028802+00	2026-10-28 13:00:55.035661+00
