06887695-c094-4c17-bc82-7e26db78e0c0	59e01f6e-dfd8-4328-a8fb-2e91d9dae01e	152b9eb4-dfe9-424b-b39c-be25b0a08e8c	16	assistant	agent	conversor	\N	Q: Complete RAG pipeline from ingestion to generation\n**In IDP, documents land in S3, get extracted and chunked, embedded into pgvector, then retrieved with graph context to ground the LLM's answer.**\n- An S3 upload fires EventBridge, which triggers a Lambda that extracts text with Textract and updates ingestion status.\n- The text is split into chunks, embedded with SentenceTransformer, and stored in pgvector with tenant and document metadata.\n- At query time I embed the question, retrieve the closest chunks, and add graph entity context for related facts.\n- The LLM answers through the LiteLLM adapter using only that context, and I measure quality with RAGAS and trace it in Langfuse.\n\n```text\n[S3 upload] --> [EventBridge]\n         v\n[Lambda: Textract OCR]\n         v\n[Chunk + SentenceTransformer]\n         v\n[pgvector] <-- [Query embedding]\n         v\n[Top-k + graph context]\n         v\n[LLM via LiteLLM]\n         v\n[RAGAS + Langfuse]\n```	claude-opus-5-5	6343	1374	4861	{"roles": {"interviewee": "unknown", "interviewer": "mic"}}	2026-10-29 04:43:32.951723+00	2026-10-29 04:43:33.081523+00
