af206577-93a3-486a-b971-277979d83427	67de7202-5b33-43b0-b70f-06323a6cc71e	3fe86cf9-e768-4b5a-8ea6-2050bd32be3c	534	assistant	agent	conversor	\N	Q: Parameters to check before finalizing the schema\n\n**Before finalizing, I check the schema against the copilot's real questions, the entities in the documents, and how we identify and secure them.**\n- First, I list the questions the copilot must answer, because those query patterns decide which nodes and relationships we need.\n- Then I sample documents of each type to see which entities, like device, network, CVE and policy, actually appear often.\n- I fix unique keys such as hostname or CVE ID, so the same entity from different documents merges into one node.\n- I also check relationship direction, time-changing properties, and document access levels, because security data needs per-user filtering.	claude-opus-5-5	9464	616	3297	{"roles": {"interviewee": "mic", "interviewer": "loopback"}}	2026-10-29 10:39:57.520552+00	2026-10-29 10:39:57.523451+00
